<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak 1996 foreign trade deficit SKK 64.54 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak 1996 foreign trade deficit SKK 64.54 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak foreign trade deficit for the whole of 1996 widened to 64.54 billion crowns from a deficit of 48.82 billion crowns for January-November, and a revised 5.69 billion crown gap for January-December 1995, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREIGN TRADE   Jan-Dec' 96  Jan-Nov'96 Jan-Dec'95</p>
<p>  exports (SKK bln)	270.63	 247.54     255.10</p>
<p>  imports		    335.17	 296.36     260.79</p>
<p>  balance		    -64.54	 -48.82	-5.69</p>
<p>((  -- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687 )) REUTE</p>
</text>
